<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised Biopsys Medical Inc to buy from attractive, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/8 to 22.</p>
